{
  "_note": "连续天数(11,68×60,card-design-system §8.2):事项名 / 连续几天 / 「连续天数」。底行今天已达标时用事项主题色(mc),否则次级灰 —— 与 22 档 streak 的「今天已达标」同一个色义。\n手写产物(tools/checkin/gen_rcn.py 已漂移、没有这张);取数复用 flow/streak.df,零新增键。\n主值字号恒 20pt:连续天数 ≤ 4 位(9999 天 ≈ 27 年),不会到 5 字符,故不需要流给 vf。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EEF7F3)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161B1D\\,#182221)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "8pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "17pt",
        "y": "7pt",
        "w": "43pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${iname},${@i18n.pickItem})]",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,if::(eq::(${has},1),1,0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "num",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "22pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${streak},0)]",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "还没有记录(或没选事项):值位只画「--」,不写说明(card-design-system §5 / §8)。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,if::(eq::(${has},1),0,1))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "numE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "28pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "numM",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "31pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "••",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "foot",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "8pt",
        "y": "46pt",
        "w": "54pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "${@i18n.u11}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${done},1),${mc},#6B7280|#8E939B)]"
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "pickItem": "选择事项",
        "u11": "连续天数"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "pickItem": "Habit",
        "u11": "day streak"
      }
    }
  }
}
